lines = Array[String](["Good day! I am Royal Farai.", "My life is soon to be filled with more magic as I will meet Princess Rei in but four days!", "I understand she will serve in Vigoust’s military, and request your help in obtaining letter-writing materials. If we manage to hit it off, I want to show her my commitment for keeping in contact.", "Here’s hoping it goes splendid!"])
